{"knowledge_id":"K-COVER-0001","source_id":"SRC-SYS-002","source_type":"platform_policy","source_title":"平台空間關係與圖面證據審查準則 v2","page":null,"source_section":"建築計畫","exam_type":"both","topics":["program_completeness","functional_adjacency","concept_spatialization"],"unit_role":"evaluation_rule","evaluation_layer":"core_quality","knowledge_type":"soft_rule","statement":"應分開查核題目目標、使用者需求、機能清單與設計概念是否在平面、配置和剖面上有可對應的空間解答；概念口號不能取代實際配置。","conditions":["題目或圖面提供相關資訊時"],"exceptions":["題目缺漏時只給暫評，不推定硬性需求"],"evidence_targets":["題目需求","空間名稱與配置","概念圖和平面對照"],"severity_hint":"medium","reasoning":"建築計畫需要能回答題目而非僅表現圖形。","remediation":["列出需求與作答位置的對照","補強欠缺的空間解題"],"image_refs":[],"quote_or_paraphrase":"platform_rule","curation_status":"canonical"}
{"knowledge_id":"K-COVER-0002","source_id":"SRC-SYS-002","source_type":"platform_policy","source_title":"平台空間關係與圖面證據審查準則 v2","page":null,"source_section":"環境控制","exam_type":"both","topics":["daylight","ventilation","shade_strategy","orientation"],"unit_role":"evaluation_rule","evaluation_layer":"core_quality","knowledge_type":"soft_rule","statement":"環境控制要從朝向、開口、剖面、遮陽與氣流路徑檢查可見策略和空間使用的關係；沒有方位或剖面時，不可憑想像宣稱性能。","conditions":["題目或圖面涉及氣候回應時"],"exceptions":["缺方位、立面或剖面時列待查"],"evidence_targets":["指北與日照","門窗開口","遮陽構件","通風路徑"],"severity_hint":"medium","reasoning":"環境策略需落在圖面上的具體構件及空間。","remediation":["標示環境策略的對象與構件","補充必要剖面或開口位置"],"image_refs":[],"quote_or_paraphrase":"platform_rule","curation_status":"canonical"}
{"knowledge_id":"K-COVER-0003","source_id":"SRC-SYS-002","source_type":"platform_policy","source_title":"平台空間關係與圖面證據審查準則 v2","page":null,"source_section":"綠建築永續","exam_type":"both","topics":["green_system","water_strategy","shade_strategy"],"unit_role":"evaluation_rule","evaluation_layer":"core_quality","knowledge_type":"soft_rule","statement":"綠化、雨水、遮蔭與資源策略應說明位置、連續性、使用及維護；僅畫綠色區塊或寫永續字樣，不足以證明策略成立。","conditions":["題目要求或方案提出永續策略時"],"exceptions":["沒有相關條件時不強求所有策略"],"evidence_targets":["植栽與基地界面","水流與滯洪位置","遮蔭構件","維護可達性"],"severity_hint":"medium","reasoning":"永續應從圖面可查的配置與空間效益判斷。","remediation":["把永續主張對應到可定位構件","標出水、綠與使用動線的關係"],"image_refs":[],"quote_or_paraphrase":"platform_rule","curation_status":"canonical"}
{"knowledge_id":"K-COVER-0004","source_id":"SRC-SYS-002","source_type":"platform_policy","source_title":"平台空間關係與圖面證據審查準則 v2","page":null,"source_section":"構造結構","exam_type":"both","topics":["structural_plausibility","massing","vertical_circulation"],"unit_role":"evaluation_rule","evaluation_layer":"core_quality","knowledge_type":"soft_rule","statement":"從柱網、核心、跨度、量體、立剖關係檢查初步構造合理性；看不見尺寸或結構資料時，只能提出核對需求，不可宣稱結構安全與否。","conditions":["圖面有柱、核心或結構構件時"],"exceptions":["單張配置圖不足以判定跨度及結構安全"],"evidence_targets":["柱與牆的連續性","核心位置","跨距標示","平剖對應"],"severity_hint":"medium","reasoning":"結構推論要守住圖面證據範圍。","remediation":["以柱網與剖面補明受力邏輯","核對衝突位置"],"image_refs":[],"quote_or_paraphrase":"platform_rule","curation_status":"canonical"}
{"knowledge_id":"K-COVER-0005","source_id":"SRC-SYS-002","source_type":"platform_policy","source_title":"平台空間關係與圖面證據審查準則 v2","page":null,"source_section":"無障礙及法規來源","exam_type":"both","topics":["accessible_route","ramp","egress","authority_separation"],"unit_role":"evaluation_rule","evaluation_layer":"core_quality","knowledge_type":"soft_rule","statement":"可檢視入口、坡道、垂直動線及避難路徑的連續性；若要斷言法規合格、違規或精確尺寸，必須引用適用法規版本與可讀尺寸，否則列為待核對。","conditions":["題目或圖面包含相關通路時"],"exceptions":["平台教學準則不是正式法規"],"evidence_targets":["題目或法規出處","出入口與通路","標高與尺寸","樓梯及坡道"],"severity_hint":"high","reasoning":"避免把設計建議誤寫成法律判斷。","remediation":["補明路徑、標高與尺寸","另核對當期適用法規"],"image_refs":[],"quote_or_paraphrase":"platform_rule","curation_status":"canonical"}
{"knowledge_id":"K-COVER-0006","source_id":"SRC-SYS-002","source_type":"platform_policy","source_title":"平台空間關係與圖面證據審查準則 v2","page":null,"source_section":"保留優點","exam_type":"both","topics":["evidence_grounding","concept_spatialization","spatial_hierarchy"],"unit_role":"review_policy","evaluation_layer":null,"knowledge_type":"soft_rule","statement":"審查除了缺失，還應指出有圖面證據且有效回應題目或空間使用的做法，註明值得維持的理由與位置；不得為鼓勵而虛構優點。","conditions":["有可辨識的具體優點時"],"exceptions":["圖面不清時不強制給正面意見"],"evidence_targets":["可定位的空間策略","題目對應","使用效益"],"severity_hint":"low","reasoning":"保留有效策略可避免修改造成新問題。","remediation":["修改時保護有效的動線、界面及空間關係"],"image_refs":[],"quote_or_paraphrase":"platform_rule","curation_status":"canonical"}
